      "proposed_content": "For xi, completion preserves the nonreal zeta-zero problem while exposing the reflection s maps to 1-s; combined with the zero-free-half-plane theorem, strict horizontal modulus monotonicity on either side of the critical line becomes an equivalent certificate for excluding off-critical zeros.",
